            {"h": "Tips for winning more", "ul": ["Uncover face-down cards in the tallest columns before you tidy small piles.", "Use the hint if you are stuck. Hints in Cardles look for a sensible next move and will suggest dealing when nothing else is left.", "Undo is free and unlimited, so test a line and step back if it blocks you.", "Count your suits. If you hold several cards of a rank already, think about where the missing ones are before you bury them."]},
